From e225cba01ec8898f0f38b84fb620958b56e35b8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ferrous Goose <ferrous@goose.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:30:14 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Export fns with several results and builder parameters
 (Ferrous Goose 0002)

The first result is C's return value and each further one an out-pointer;
a builder parameter is a scratch builder the runtime keeps per parameter,
whose elements and count the wrapper hands back, valid until the next
exported call.
---
